# README

## BookStack → DokuWiki Migration Tool

Standalone tool for exporting BookStack documentation to DokuWiki format with auto-detection and auto-loading.

### Quick Start

```bash
# Detect DokuWiki installations
python bookstack-migrate detect

# Export BookStack to DokuWiki
python bookstack-migrate export --db bookstack --user root --password secret
```

### Build

```bash
# All-in-one build (tests, packaging, binaries)
bash build/all.sh

# Just binaries
bash build/binaries.sh

# Just Docker tests
bash build/docker-test.sh
```

### Package

```bash
pip install -e .
bookstack-migrate detect
```

### Files

- `bookstack-migrate` - Main executable (no dependencies except mysql driver)
- `build/` - Build scripts (docker, binaries, all)
- `dist/` - Generated binaries and packages
- `tests/` - Test suite

### CI/CD

GitHub Actions runs `build/all.sh` on every commit.
